I started with a website called History of Vadodara where I was able to combine my passion for old and new pictures of our town. I received unstoppable support from my friends and family that pushed me to try my luck at more.

I started professional photography in 2016 and within couple years I have garnered incredible clients. Krishna Shah Photography captures old world charm in the modern world and futuristic notes in traditional work. We specialise in weddings, portraits, food photography and customised events.

Today, I feel honoured to be able to share my work and be part of this amazing photography community.

We’ve been incredibly honored to find our work featured in National Geographic Traveller India’s #ColoursOfGujarat contest, powered by Gujarat Tourism, not just once, but twice (Instagram post embedded below)! And as if that wasn’t exciting enough, one of our rituals image has also made its way into ShaadiWish’s Wedding Rituals Post. It’s always a wonderful surprise to see our passion recognised on such esteemed platforms!','["Wedding","Pre-Wedding","Reception","Engagement","Haldi","Mehndi","Birthday","Corporate","Portfolio","Other","Katha","Rituals","Meeting"]'::jsonb,'','Asia/Kolkata','','',4,'Gujarat','','Photography','[{"id":"mt1","title":"Bride Side","color":"#ec4899"},{"id":"mt2","title":"Groom Side","color":"#2980b9"},{"id":"mt3","title":"Common","color":"#2c3e50"}]'::jsonb,'1-2, Basement, Lad Apt, V K Marg, Vadodara 390001',true,'Krishna Shah Photography','DD/MM/YYYY','free','6aa21c32-bf65-87c9-83e2-f0fe00000000','2026-09-10T02:55:46.564000','2026-09-21T11:27:31.908000','6aa20f28-3c80-81b6-ff82-05cf00000000') ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;

